Fix AdviceLabel::onNanoDisplay(): the `text` data member shadows NanoVG's
text() method, making the draw call uncallable

Generated against AudioPluginsCommon (spellbound-common) tag v0.8.0, the
version pinned by this repo's CMakeLists.txt AudioPluginsCommon GIT_TAG.
File: src/hui/dgl/AdviceLabel.cpp.

WHAT IS BROKEN
--------------
AdviceLabel.h declares a private `std::string text;` data member. Inside
AdviceLabel::onNanoDisplay(), the unqualified call

    text(textX, textY, text.c_str(), nullptr);

resolves the callee `text` to that data member (ordinary unqualified name
lookup finds the innermost declaration first), not to the inherited
DGL::NanoVG::text(float, float, const char*, const char*) method -- so this
tries to call operator() on a std::string, which doesn't exist:

    error: no match for call to '(std::string) (const float&, const float&,
    const char*, std::nullptr_t)'

Same root cause as the CorrelationGauge patch in this same directory: this
widget is new in v0.8.0 and had never actually been compiled by any
downstream consumer before this task (TrueSight Task 7) tried to (see
Common's own CLAUDE.md: `common/hui/dgl` only builds inside a project that
already called dpf_add_plugin(), which Common's own standalone build never
does).

THE FIX
-------
Explicitly qualify the call as NanoVG::text(...) to bypass the data member
and reach the base class method directly. AdviceLabel inherits from NanoVG
via NanoSubWidget -> NanoBaseWidget<SubWidget> -> NanoVG, so the qualified
name is directly reachable, no forwarding needed.

VERIFICATION
------------
Rebuilt `audioplugins_common_hui_dgl` (part of TrueSight's normal
`cmake --build build --parallel`) after applying this patch: compiles clean,
no warnings. Confirmed by direct edit-then-build in
build/_deps/audiopluginscommon-src before generating this patch from `git
diff` there.

Not yet reported upstream to spellbound-common.

diff --git a/src/hui/dgl/AdviceLabel.cpp b/src/hui/dgl/AdviceLabel.cpp
index e05151c..401f6b5 100644
--- a/src/hui/dgl/AdviceLabel.cpp
+++ b/src/hui/dgl/AdviceLabel.cpp
@@ -108,7 +108,7 @@ void AdviceLabel::onNanoDisplay()
         const float textX = kPadding;
         const float textY = h / 2.f;

-        text(textX, textY, text.c_str(), nullptr);
+        NanoVG::text(textX, textY, text.c_str(), nullptr);
         closePath();
     }
 }
